<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Comdisco target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Comdisco target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Shao Wang raised the price target for Comdisco Inc to $42 and repeated a buy rating on the stock, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- analyst did not have immediate comment.</p>
<p>-- shares jumped 4-1/4 to 37-1/4.  </p>
<p>-- other details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
